WEBVTT


1
00:00:00.760 --> 00:00:05.280
In Latvia, we are very conscious of the need for people to

2
00:00:05.320 --> 00:00:08.680
protect themselves from fire in their own homes.

3
00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:12.760
Sadly, the most of fire fatalities occur in households.

4
00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:16.880
This is why we introduced a new legal requirement to

5
00:00:16.880 --> 00:00:22.750
install smoke alarms in domestic homes since 1st January

6
00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:28.480
2020. We here in Latvia strongly support this European wide

7
00:00:28.480 --> 00:00:32.440
campaign to install smoke detectors in people's homes.

8
00:00:33.120 --> 00:00:36.480
Smoke detectors do save lives.

9
00:00:36.520 --> 00:00:38.480
Install smoke detectors today.